inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORITA, KOUZI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAMURA, KOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, FUMIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, KOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYAMA, NAOTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An unpolished work holding board having a high-precision work holding surface obtained by improving materials for the holding board body of an unpolished work holding board which vacuum-sucks/holds a work and for a resin coating spread on a work holding surface, and by developing a resin coating method which does not close with resin through holes in the holding board body; and a production method thereof. An unpolished work holding board provided with a work holding board body having many through holes for vacuum-sucking/holding a work, wherein the holding surface of the holding board body is covered with a coating formed by heat-curing a thermosetting resin spread on the holding surface and the surface of the coating is polished; and a production method thereof.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un plan de maintien de pièces non poli avec surface de travail de haute précision grâce à l'emploi de matériaux améliorés pour le corps du plan de maintien. Ce plan aspire/maintient pas dépression la pièce à ouvrer. L'invention concerne également une méthode d'application sur le plan de maintien, et l'application proprement dite, d'une couche de résine qui n'obture pas les trous traversants du corps du plan de maintien ainsi que le procédé de fabrication de cette résine. L'invention concerne un plan de maintien non poli avec un corps présentant des trous traversants pour l'aspiration/maintien par dépression, plan dont la surface du plan de maintien est recouverte d'une couche de résine thermodurcissable ultérieurement polie.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>